{"publicId":"30d85a52-38e4-4e73-a1a3-29f66eacd8f1","title":"Ledger SDK默认发送签名元数据，Ambire已排除受影响版本","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T16:20:09.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-10T16:20:09.000Z","digest":"Ledger的SDK现默认包含签名元数据（含设备详情和交易目的地地址），Ambire称已将受影响版本排除在生产环境之外【新】.\n\n签名元数据通常包含交易签名、设备信息及收付款地址等隐私数据，默认发送可能引发安全风险。Ambire的声明未说明排除范围和修复时间表，仅称受影响版本已从生产环境移除【新】.\n\nThe Defiant报道显示，当前SDK版本（未明确具体版本号）默认启用该功能，Ambire作为Ledger的生态合作方，通过技术手段隔离了相关代码模块【新】.","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-10T16:32:14.471Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Ledger SDK 默认发送签名元数据","latestReport":{"id":"tfl382borbbaqv01gbqkyyumq"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f7rfIqHjJ9SU","title":"Ledger SDK 默认发送签名元数据","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T16:20:09.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"tfl382borbbaqv01gbqkyyumq","title":"Ledger SDK 默认发送签名元数据","summary":"Ledger 的 SDK 现默认包含目的地地址和设备详情的签名元数据；Ambire 表示已将受影响版本排除在生产环境之外。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T16:20:09.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"tfl382borbbaqv01gbqkyyumq","title":"Ledger SDK 默认发送签名元数据","summary":"Ledger 的 SDK 现默认包含目的地地址和设备详情的签名元数据；Ambire 表示已将受影响版本排除在生产环境之外。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T16:20:09.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-10T17:00:00.000Z","heat":9.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T19:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T23:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T00:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T02:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T03:00:00.000Z","heat":7.3,"partici